Packages jose, jose/jws, jose/jwt, jose/jwk, jose/internal/ec and
jose/internal/errtext are written from scratch.

Third-party code: none is copied into this module. It depends on
github.com/decred/dcrd/dcrec/secp256k1/v4 (ISC License) for secp256k1.

Package jose/sdjwt is ported from two projects licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The code
was rewritten in Go, not copied; each ported file starts with a header naming
its source files.

  sd-jwt-python, commit c5fda017d15e65a6c61a31e696bcdbdab2966b1e
  https://github.com/openwallet-foundation-labs/sd-jwt-python
  Copyright the sd-jwt-python contributors (OpenWallet Foundation Labs).
    sdjwt/disclosure.go  from src/sd_jwt/disclosure.py
    sdjwt/conceal.go     from src/sd_jwt/issuer.py
    sdjwt/recreate.go    from src/sd_jwt/verifier.py
    sdjwt/split.go       from src/sd_jwt/common.py

  eudi-lib-jvm-sdjwt-kt, commit 19f408b901bac0246ae801acf8533b914a920d8c
  https://github.com/eu-digital-identity-wallet/eudi-lib-jvm-sdjwt-kt
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 European Commission.
    sdjwt/disclosure.go  from Disclosure.kt
    sdjwt/conceal.go     from DecoyGen.kt
    sdjwt/recreate.go    from RecreateClaims.kt, SdJwtVerifier.kt
  (paths under src/main/kotlin/eu/europa/ec/eudi/sdjwt/)

sdjwt/kb.go is written from RFC 9901 Sections 4.3 and 7.3, not ported.

